WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.020
Three pins stand on
three-dimensional axes,

2
00:00:03.070 --> 00:00:05.060
each at a different height.

3
00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:07.140
Lay a sheet of card on top.

4
00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:11.080
It settles at a tilt,
resting on all three tips.

5
00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:13.400
Now stand a pencil on the card.

6
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.140
It wobbles, until it's
exactly upright to the card.

7
00:00:17.190 --> 00:00:21.160
Could you compute that upright
direction from the three points alone?

8
00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:25.840
In this mission, you'll see that vectors
joining the points lie in the plane.

9
00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:30.030
You'll meet the vector product, which
makes a new vector at right angles to two

10
00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:31.920
given vectors at once.

11
00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:36.780
And you'll see how a normal vector leads
straight to the equation of a plane.

12
00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:41.180
Your mission: find the direction that
sticks straight out of a plane fixed by

13
00:00:41.230 --> 00:00:42.370
three points.
